Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 22:34:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 06/10] =?UTF-8?q?fix:=20=E7=A7=BB=E9=99=A4=20init.qcom.rc?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20=E9=87=8C=E7=AC=AC=E4=BA=8C=E4=BB=BD=20wpa=5Fsupplicant=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E5=AE=9A=E4=B9=89=EF=BC=88=E5=90=8C=E5=90=8D=E5=86=B2=E7=AA=81?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=EF=BC=89?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

根因（supplicant 不被拉起，wlan0 停在 DOWN）:
init.qcom.rc:570-587 保留了原厂 HIDL 时代的
  service wpa_supplicant /vendor/bin/hw/wpa_supplicant ...
      interface android.hardware.wifi.supplicant@1.0::ISupplicant default
      ... (@1.1/@1.2/@1.3 + vendor.qti...@2.0/2.1/2.2)
      socket vendor_wpa_wlan0 ...
它与 AOSP 的 AIDL 定义同名（后者由
external/wpa_supplicant_8/wpa_supplicant/aidl/android.hardware.wifi.supplicant-service.rc
经 LOCAL_INIT_RC 安装到 /vendor/etc/init/），声明
      interface aidl android.hardware.wifi.supplicant.ISupplicant/default

init 的 ServiceParser::ParseInterface 对重复 interface 报错
  "Interface '<name>' redefined in <svc> but is already defined by <svc>"
于是 AIDL interface 未被注册，servicemanager 请求 lazy 启动时 init 找不到：

  init: Control message: Could not find
    'aidl/android.hardware.wifi.supplicant.ISupplicant/default'
    for ctl.interface_start from pid: 642 (/system/bin/servicemanager)
  W/ServiceManagerCppClient: Waited one second for
    android.hardware.wifi.supplicant.ISupplicant/default
  W/libc: Unable to set property "ctl.interface_start" ...: error code: 0x20

反证：`setprop ctl.start wpa_supplicant` 能成功（服务名存在），
只有 interface 路径失效——正是 interface 注册被丢弃的症状。
手动启动后 `cmd wifi status` 立刻变为 "Wifi is enabled"。

改动：注释掉该重复定义，交由 AOSP 的 rc 提供唯一权威定义。
保留 `service hostapd_fst`（服务名不同，不冲突）与
`service vendor.wigig_supplicant`（wigig 专用，未受影响）。
---
 rootdir/etc/init.qcom.rc | 46 ++++++++++++++++++++++++----------------
 1 file changed, 28 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

diff --git a/rootdir/etc/init.qcom.rc b/rootdir/etc/init.qcom.rc
index f920653..9fc033f 100644
--- a/rootdir/etc/init.qcom.rc
+++ b/rootdir/etc/init.qcom.rc
@@ -567,24 +567,34 @@ service qmiproxy /system/bin/qmiproxy
     group radio diag
     disabled
 
-service wpa_supplicant /vendor/bin/hw/wpa_supplicant \
-    -O/data/vendor/wifi/wpa/sockets -puse_p2p_group_interface=1 -dd \
-    -g@android:vendor_wpa_wlan0
-#   we will start as root and wpa_supplicant will switch to user wifi
-#   after setting up the capabilities required for WEXT
-#   user wifi
-#   group wifi inet keystore
-    interface android.hardware.wifi.supplicant@1.0::ISupplicant default
-    interface android.hardware.wifi.supplicant@1.1::ISupplicant default
-    interface android.hardware.wifi.supplicant@1.2::ISupplicant default
-    interface android.hardware.wifi.supplicant@1.3::ISupplicant default
-    interface vendor.qti.hardware.wifi.supplicant@2.0::ISupplicantVendor default
-    interface vendor.qti.hardware.wifi.supplicant@2.1::ISupplicantVendor default
-    interface vendor.qti.hardware.wifi.supplicant@2.2::ISupplicantVendor default
-    class main
-    socket vendor_wpa_wlan0 dgram 660 wifi wifi
-    disabled
-    oneshot
+# 原厂在此定义了第二份 `service wpa_supplicant`（HIDL 时代内容：
+#   interface android.hardware.wifi.supplicant@1.0::ISupplicant default ...），
+# 与 AOSP 的 AIDL 定义（external/wpa_supplicant_8/wpa_supplicant/aidl/
+# android.hardware.wifi.supplicant-service.rc，声明
+#   interface aidl android.hardware.wifi.supplicant.ISupplicant/default）**同名冲突**。
+# init 的 ServiceParser::ParseInterface 对重复 interface 报
+#   "Interface '<name>' redefined in <svc> but is already defined by <svc>"
+# 导致 AIDL interface 注册失败，servicemanager 报：
+#   init: Control message: Could not find
+#     'aidl/android.hardware.wifi.supplicant.ISupplicant/default'
+#     for ctl.interface_start from pid: 642 (/system/bin/servicemanager)
+# → supplicant 不作为 lazy AIDL 服务被拉起，wlan0 停在 DOWN。
+# 故此处不再定义，交由 AOSP 的 rc 提供唯一权威定义。
+#
+# service wpa_supplicant /vendor/bin/hw/wpa_supplicant \
+#     -O/data/vendor/wifi/wpa/sockets -puse_p2p_group_interface=1 -dd \
+#     -g@android:vendor_wpa_wlan0
+#     interface android.hardware.wifi.supplicant@1.0::ISupplicant default
+#     interface android.hardware.wifi.supplicant@1.1::ISupplicant default
+#     interface android.hardware.wifi.supplicant@1.2::ISupplicant default
+#     interface android.hardware.wifi.supplicant@1.3::ISupplicant default
+#     interface vendor.qti.hardware.wifi.supplicant@2.0::ISupplicantVendor default
+#     interface vendor.qti.hardware.wifi.supplicant@2.1::ISupplicantVendor default
+#     interface vendor.qti.hardware.wifi.supplicant@2.2::ISupplicantVendor default
+#     class main
+#     socket vendor_wpa_wlan0 dgram 660 wifi wifi
+#     disabled
+#     oneshot
 
 service vendor.wigig_supplicant /vendor/bin/hw/wpa_supplicant \
     -iwigig0 -Dnl80211 -c/data/vendor/wifi/wigig_supplicant.conf \
